    "forward_left": {
      "part": "skin_forward_L",
      "description": "The left forward fuselage side below the cockpit, between the radome and intake. Forward is toward the radome. The closed gun-port panel is an avionics access cover, no gun opening. Frame stations support circumferential fastener rows, not a dense rectangular greeble grid. Leave clean stencil zones under the cockpit sill; decals come later. The canopy sill is above this sheet, the intake is aft.",
