    "wing_root": {
      "part": "wing_skin_L",
      "description": "The upper inboard wing root and strake, joining the left fuselage fillet to the main upper wing. A narrow curved sheet, not an entire triangular wing. The yellow guide zone indicates a restrained antislip walkway near the fuselage. It is a subtle grey material change with soft shoe scuffs, no black racing stripe or text. Blue structural lines follow the actual spars and ribs. Outboard it meets the upper wing.",
