    "fin_left": {
      "part": "fin_skin",
      "description": "Left face of the vertical fin, its lower root fillet and small top cap, above the rear fuselage. The rudder is a separate trailing control surface and is absent. Use a fine perimeter joint near that cut boundary, a few flush fasteners near the base and one restrained root service cover. No invented fin spar grid: the current model has no separate fin spar layout exported here. Keep broad skin clean. Generated detail is reflected in aircraft world coordinates to the other face; the compositor adds readable separate fin markings.",
